<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH UTILITY SEVEROCESKA 9MO GROSS DROPS.</title>
<headline>CZECH UTILITY SEVEROCESKA 9MO GROSS DROPS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine</p>
<p>months ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	   306.277	vs	518.495</p>
<p> Total sales	  6,519.386	vs    6,137.500</p>
<p> Operating profit	   n/a	vs	543.585</p>
<p> Total assets		 n/a	vs    7,334.681</p>
<p> Basic capital		n/a	vs    3,253.008</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Severoceska Energetika a.s.. It</p>
<p>is the northern Czech eletctricity distributor. Figures,</p>
<p>provided by the company itself, did not include operating</p>
<p>profit, total assets and basic capital data. Severoceska is</p>
<p>listed on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
